  "body": "Today the `ImageBitmap` interface is vended from [`createImageBitmap()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ImageBitmap) (among others). Giving this type a constructor would bring it into harmony with other recent DOM types.\r\n\r\nThis was brought up in regards to: https://github.com/w3ctag/spec-reviews/issues/141\r\n\r\n/cc @dbaron @travisleithead @torgo @junov ",
